		{
			"id": "efE2RLOO5MyRv0uWf",
			"description": "Pump Shotgun",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A civilian and militia pump-action scattergun common on agri and feral worlds and among hive gangers — a step down from the military combat shotgun, and the more commonly depicted shotgun among non-military characters in Imperial fiction.\n\nDesign: Same buckshot/slug split as the Combat Shotgun, toned down roughly half a die (matching the Combat Shotgun's own new figures) and locked to RoF 1 (manual pump cycling, no autofire) to reflect civilian manufacture rather than a military select-fire action: buckshot averages 14 (66.4% through flak at point-blank range), slug averages 19.5 and still fails against carapace (0% of hits).",
